{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":105204,"num_turns":1,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a3295435-47b6-4821-bfca-fa4963e69da8","total_cost_usd":0.6691715,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":40875,"cache_read_input_tokens":16967,"output_tokens":9102,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":40875,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":9102,"cache_read_input_tokens":16967,"cache_creation_input_tokens":40875,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":40875},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":24273,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.024378,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":9102,"cacheReadInputTokens":16967,"cacheCreationInputTokens":40875,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6447935,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\n  \"agent\": \"debris-designer\",\n  \"size_classes\": {\n    \"small\":     { \"slots_crushed\": 1, \"slots_uncrushed\": 2, \"hand_tetherable\": true },\n    \"medium\":    { \"slots_crushed\": 2, \"slots_uncrushed\": 4, \"hand_tetherable\": true },\n    \"oversized\": { \"slots_crushed\": 6, \"slots_uncrushed\": 12, \"hand_tetherable\": false }\n  },\n  \"debris\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scorched_hull_panel\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Scorched Hull Panel\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 12.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 16,\n      \"notes\": \"A curved sheet of blackened skin off a booster fairing, light enough to tether without thinking and common enough to be the first thing most players ever latch.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"insulation_blanket_wad\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Insulation Blanket Wad\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 4.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 12,\n      \"notes\": \"A crumpled ball of multi-layer foil that barely registers on the tether, the cheapest thing in the sky and the safest filler for a last slot.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"spent_bolt_cluster\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Spent Bolt Cluster\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 6.5,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 10,\n      \"notes\": \"Separation hardware fused into a knot of studs and collars, dense for its size and the closest thing the low sky has to honest metal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bent_truss_section\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Bent Truss Section\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 34.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 9,\n      \"notes\": \"A folded length of lattice strut that swings wide on every turn, the piece that teaches a new player what a towed load actually feels like.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"launch_clamp_arm\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Launch Clamp Arm\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 41.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 6,\n      \"notes\": \"Ground-support steel that rode up with something and never came down, the heaviest routine haul in the cheap band.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"antenna_whip\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Antenna Whip\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 3.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 4,\n      \"notes\": \"A springy monopole that glints as it tumbles, almost weightless on the line but never crushable, so it costs full uncrushed slots the whole way home.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_viewport_pane\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Viewport Pane\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 9.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 2,\n      \"notes\": \"Laminated capsule glass with a star fracture through it, the suborbital band's one real prize and the first lesson in landing gently.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"upper_stage_shroud\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Upper Stage Shroud\",\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"size_class\": \"oversized\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 180.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 1,\n      \"notes\": \"Half a payload fairing the size of a garage door; rejects the hand magnet outright and waits for the crane cable, so it sits in the sky as a preview of a tool the shipping slice does not have.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reaction_wheel_housing\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Reaction Wheel Housing\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 62.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 9,\n      \"notes\": \"A sealed drum of bearing steel and copper, the bread-and-butter satellite wreckage of the low band and heavy enough that the trip home has to be planned.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"propellant_tank_stub\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Propellant Tank Stub\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 78.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 7,\n      \"notes\": \"A ruptured titanium sphere still wearing its mounting collar, the heaviest hand-tetherable piece a mid-game player will routinely try to drag.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"avionics_bay_module\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Avionics Bay Module\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 55.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 6,\n      \"notes\": \"A boxed rack of flight computers, solid enough to shrug off a mediocre landing and worth more than anything the suborbital band offers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"gyro_cluster\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Gyro Cluster\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 24.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 8,\n      \"notes\": \"Three rate gyros still bolted to their machined mount, dense for one slot and the efficient pick when the hold is nearly full.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"thruster_quad_pod\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Thruster Quad Pod\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 19.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 7,\n      \"notes\": \"Four attitude jets on a common manifold, compact and forgiving, the low band's answer to the hull panel.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_solar_array\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Solar Array\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 28.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 4,\n      \"notes\": \"A wing of cells with half its panes starred; light for its bulk but never crushable, so it eats four slots and doubles every point of heat and landing damage.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"star_tracker_head\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Star Tracker Head\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 14.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 2,\n      \"notes\": \"A baffled optical head with the lens still clean, small and precious and the cheapest way for the player to learn what fragile costs on the way down.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"dish_reflector\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Dish Reflector\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 31.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 2,\n      \"notes\": \"A parabolic mesh reflector that catches the sun on a slow cycle from half a screen away, spawning off the clumps and above its band so reaching it is a real burn.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"despun_bus_frame\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Despun Bus Frame\",\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"size_class\": \"oversized\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 340.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 1,\n      \"notes\": \"The gutted spaceframe of a comsat, crane-cable only and heavy enough on its own to change the reentry profile; unreachable in the shipping slice by design.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"iridium_bus_core\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Iridium Bus Core\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 165.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 7,\n      \"notes\": \"The dense structural heart of a constellation satellite, the high band's staple and by itself a third of what a starting hold can carry.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reactor_core_slug\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Reactor Core Slug\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 180.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 6,\n      \"notes\": \"A shielded block off a dead nuclear power unit, the single heaviest hand-tetherable piece in the game and a deliberate test of whether the player's chute can still hold five metres a second.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cryo_pump_assembly\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cryo Pump Assembly\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 140.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 6,\n      \"notes\": \"A turbopump and its cold plumbing welded into one lump, solid enough to survive a rough entry when the rest of the haul will not.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"gold_foil_instrument_can\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Gold Foil Instrument Can\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 48.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 6,\n      \"notes\": \"A wrapped cylinder of science hardware, one slot crushed and dense with the good metals, the high band's efficiency pick.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rtg_capsule\",\n      \"display_name\": \"RTG Capsule\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 88.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 4,\n      \"notes\": \"A thermoelectric generator casing built to survive reentry on its own, absurdly heavy for one slot and the strongest argument for a Parachute upgrade.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"optical_bench\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Optical Bench\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 95.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 4,\n      \"notes\": \"A mirror and its invar frame, heavy and uncrushable at once, so a single one occupies four slots and doubles its own damage the whole way down.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"sensor_gimbal_head\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Sensor Gimbal Head\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"small\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 60.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 3,\n      \"notes\": \"A pointing head with its optics intact, dense for a small piece and fragile with it, so latch jerk at high closing speed is the real risk rather than the tow.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"deep_space_dish\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Deep Space Dish\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"medium\",\n      \"fragile\": true,\n      \"mass_kg\": 110.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 3,\n      \"notes\": \"A rigid high-gain antenna off something that was never meant to come back, glinting on its own fast orbit well off the clumps; the whole skill chain from crossing to touchdown pays out on this one piece.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"comsat_main_body\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Comsat Main Body\",\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"size_class\": \"oversized\",\n      \"fragile\": false,\n      \"mass_kg\": 620.0,\n      \"spawn_weight\": 1,\n      \"notes\": \"A whole geostationary bird minus its arrays, crane-cable only and heavier than the empty ship; it is the rehearsal object for Mr. Armstrong's satellite and is deferred with the class it belongs to.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"band_summary\": [\n    {\n      \"band\": \"suborbital\",\n      \"piece_count\": 8,\n      \"fragile_fraction\": 0.1,\n      \"mean_mass_kg\": 36.19\n    },\n    {\n      \"band\": \"low\",\n      \"piece_count\": 9,\n      \"fragile_fraction\": 0.174,\n      \"mean_mass_kg\": 72.33\n    },\n    {\n      \"band\": \"high\",\n      \"piece_count\": 9,\n      \"fragile_fraction\": 0.25,\n      \"mean_mass_kg\": 167.33\n    }\n  ],\n  \"revision_notes\": [],\n  \"design_notes\": [\n    \"Mean mass rises 36.19 -> 72.33 -> 167.33 kg, roughly 2x per band and 4.6x from suborbital to high; excluding the crane-only oversized piece from each band the same climb is 15.6 -> 39.0 -> 114.5 kg, about 7.3x, so the mass gradient is carried by the ordinary hand-tetherable pieces and not by the one outlier per band.\",\n    \"The Researcher's finding that entry speed only spans 151-164 m/s across all three bands means altitude cannot produce the band difficulty curve. This catalog puts that load on mass instead, which is the lever GDD 4.5 risk 2 already names: a full high-band hold is several times the tonnage of a full suborbital one under the same chute and the same shield, so deceleration authority falls and integrated heat rises exactly as the haul gets good.\",\n    \"Fragile spawn weight is 6/60 = 0.100 in suborbital, 8/46 = 0.174 in low and 10/40 = 0.250 in high, computed as the weighted share rather than the piece-count share. By count the three bands are 2/8, 3/9 and 3/9, which would read as 0.25 everywhere - the weights are what hold the 1-in-10 to 1-in-4 gradient the GDD asks for.\",\n    \"Fragile pieces get low spawn weights within their band and are deliberately not the lightest things in it: cracked_viewport_pane, dish_reflector, optical_bench and deep_space_dish all cost full uncrushed slots forever and all take double heat and landing damage, so a fragile-heavy run is a genuinely worse ride home rather than free money.\",\n    \"Every size class and the fragile flag appear in both shipping-slice bands, so a player who never leaves suborbital and low still meets small, medium, oversized-that-rejects-the-hand-magnet, and fragile. The oversized pieces are one per band and exist to make the catalog complete; all three are unreachable without the crane magnet the semester scope cuts.\",\n    \"Medium is not hoarded in the top band - suborbital carries 2 mediums, low 5 and high 5 - so the skew toward medium is a shift in spawn weight and mass, not a class the player only meets after the slice ends. High-band smalls (rtg_capsule at 88 kg, sensor_gimbal_head at 60 kg) are heavier than most low-band mediums, which is how the band reads as dense rather than merely bulky.\",\n    \"Slot economics stay non-degenerate at every band: at 6 starting slots and roughly 500 kg of usable capacity, one crushed high-band medium is about a third of the hold, one crushed high-band small is about a sixth, and an uncrushed fragile medium is two thirds of it. No piece is strictly dominant because the best mass-per-slot pieces (gold_foil_instrument_can, gyro_cluster) are the ones the Economy Balancer can price below the fragile pieces that cost four slots to bring home.\"\n  ]\n}","ttft_ms":43810,"ttft_stream_ms":1253,"time_to_request_ms":303,"type":"result","duration_ms":103868,"uuid":"37e2d7e3-c452-48a7-8afd-3fd43914710f"}
